title: mira_vesser_Greet_time_of_day
tags: greeting,variable:time_of_day,npc:mira_vesser
---
// Greeting variants keyed on $time_of_day.
<<if $time_of_day == "dawn">>
    Mira Vesser: First light. No easy coin this early.
<<elseif $time_of_day == "morning">>
    Mira Vesser: Sun's barely up. What do you need?
<<elseif $time_of_day == "afternoon">>
    Mira Vesser: Afternoon. Pour yourself a drink if you're thirsty.
<<elseif $time_of_day == "dusk">>
    Mira Vesser: Dusk settling in. You here for trouble or a pint?
<<elseif $time_of_day == "night">>
    Mira Vesser: Kitchen's closed. Just drinks for now.
<<else>>
    Mira Vesser: ...
<<endif>>
===
